# AI Finance Controller — Razorpay Buildathon Track 04

## Project
A 3-way financial reconciliation agent that matches records across
BankTransaction, LedgerEntry, and SettlementRecord tables, using
**Groq primary** (Gemini failover) for ambiguous-match reasoning, and
reports a measured match rate plus an honest, explained exception list
for unresolved records.

Authoritative docs (do not contradict; decision-doc wins on conflict):
- `decision-doc.md` — locked decisions D1–D9 (D4 originally Gemini; ops
  override below is intentional for free-tier reliability)
- `design-doc.md` — how the system works (taxonomy, tiers, metrics, UI)
