## Stack — DO NOT DEVIATE
- Backend: Node.js + Express (TypeScript) in `server/`
- Frontend: React (TypeScript, Vite) in `client/`
- Database: PostgreSQL via Docker Compose at project root
  - image: `postgres:16.6`
  - container_name: `aifc_postgres`
  - named volume: `aifc_pgdata` (persists across restarts)
  - user/pass/db: `aifc_user` / `aifc_dev_pw` / `ai_finance_controller`
  - host port: `5432`
- ORM: Prisma **6.x** only (`~6.19`) — never Prisma 8 / Composer CLI
  - Schema + migrations only under `server/prisma/`
  - Import DB via `server/src/db/prisma.ts` singleton
- LLM (operational):
  - **Primary:** Groq (`groq-sdk`) — `GROQ_API_KEY`,
    `GROQ_MODEL=openai/gpt-oss-20b` (verified; `llama-3.1-8b-instant`
    returned `model_not_found` on this account)
  - **Failover:** Gemini (`@google/generative-ai`) — `GEMINI_API_KEY`,
    `GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-flash-latest` (or override)
  - Failover triggers: Groq 429/503/quota/`model_not_found`/
    `json_validate_failed`, or missing `GROQ_API_KEY`
  - Groq JSON recovery: extract `failed_generation` → repair/parse →
    one repair retry → then Gemini failover
  - Reasoning tags: `[via groq/…]`, `[via groq-repaired/…]`,
    `[via gemini-fallback/…]`
  - NEVER LangChain / LlamaIndex; NEVER silently make OpenAI/Claude
    primary; NEVER flip primary back to Gemini without explicit request
- Money: `decimal.js` + Prisma `Decimal` — never JS float math
- Package manager: npm (run installs inside `server/` or `client/`)
- Server scripts (use these):
  - `npm run seed` → `tsx src/data-generation/seedDatabase.ts`
  - `npm run reconcile` / `reconcile:tier1`
  - `npm run dev` / `start` → `tsx src/index.ts` (API :3001)
  - Prefer **tsx** over ts-node (TS7 breaks ts-node here)

